<title>PHILIPPINES: Reynolds sets record date for stock div.</title>
<headline>Reynolds sets record date for stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminium producer Reynolds Philippines Corp said it had set June 25 as the record date for its 42.85 percent stock dividend declared earlier this year.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend is set on June 16.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
